{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Kagaku na Yatsura","A \"science trouble\" romantic comedy OVA bundled with the manga's fourth volume. It follows a high school boy named Komaba Haruki and his two girl friends: the cyborg girl Airi, and the half-dog girl Ayana. The two go to extremes with the power of science, which only gets Haruki involved in ecchi troubles. \n\n\n(Source: ANN, MAL news)"],"ja":["カガクなヤツら",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-15391","ids":{"shikimori":15391,"mal":15391,"anilist":15391,"kodik":"movie-49629"},"kodikIds":["movie-49630","movie-47387","movie-49629"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-49630":"2020-02-17T12:56:13Z","movie-47387":"2020-01-09T14:44:37Z","movie-49629":"2020-02-17T12:55:25Z"},"title":"Эти чокнутые учёные","originalTitle":"Kagaku na Yatsura","alt":"カガクなヤツら カガクなヤツら","description":"Романтическая комедия о «научных проблемах». Выпущена в OVA-формате в комплекте с четвёртым томом одноимённой манги. Это история о гимназисте по имени Харуки Комаба и двух его подругах — девушке-киборге Айри и полусобаке Аяне . Эти две крайности от науки только и делают, что втягивают Харуки в этти -неприятности.","year":2013,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Комедия","Фантастика","эротика","гарем","Школа"],"rating":5.71,"popularity":7168,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/15391/8b92c4836f22bfe93ad1ba46890965ee.jpeg","width":345,"height":455},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/2199f22ed6079c6c3aa12e0969efb62249a8a26d.jpg","width":891,"height":503}},"releasedEpisodes":[1],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-739","dubId":"739","label":"Animedia","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-49630","translationId":"739","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/video/49630/225